        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-6681, 12\" Hampton Collection Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt first glance, the 12 Inch Hampton Door Handle may not seem like a show-stopper but trust us when we say that it is. Once installed, this door handle exudes a rustic charm that is full of classic beauty. The Hampton Door Pull is one of our most popular pulls because of its low-key beauty and sophisticated design. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes. Available as a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/hampton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-681\"><b>Matching Hampton Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hampton Collection Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Hampton Door Handle",
                "description": "RK International PH-6681, 12 Inch Hampton Door Handle - At first glance, the 12 Inch Hampton Door Handle may not seem like a show-stopper but trust us when we say that it is. Once installed, this door handle exudes a rustic charm that is full of classic beauty. The Hampton Door Pull is one of our most popular pulls because of its low-key beauty and sophisticated design. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes.",
